The most recent version of the Audi S5 with a V8 engine is the 2012 Audi S5 Coupe (B8 generation). The Cabriolet and Sportback versions in 2012 had a supercharged V6. The S5 Coupe was available with a 4.2L V8 FSI engine producing 354 hp and 325 lb-ft of torque. It was offered with either a 6-speed manual or a 6-speed Tiptronic automatic transmission.

